3-e858-44dc-b2af-91035a872984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c84731aff2edb37425aff8373ad6f89a, https://si.imgix.net/e335951e/uploads/origins/e2ca7353-e858-44dc-b2af-91035a872984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=056ae6df504d568be9f54247ec3855af 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e335951e/uploads/origins/e2ca7353-e858-44dc-b2af-91035a872984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e7f481c0b0951f024707bb891dd4ddd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールありがとうございます!!!ぜひ、あなたの絵を描いてください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ipeENEBL3steo3miKjxM1NTbrTGpBaoC?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@otokaju/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/425d437e/uploads/origins/cf050277-0eb3-4fa4-9554-ce0da1f7969b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d07d7b6d32da0f273c04305a2b469906", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/425d437e/uploads/origins/cf050277-0eb3-4fa4-9554-ce0da1f7969b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d07d7b6d32da0f273c04305a2b469906, https://si.imgix.net/425d437e/uploads/origins/cf050277-0eb3-4fa4-9554-ce0da1f7969b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9eeb817d1335be148e27790d522aea98 2x, https://si.imgix.net/425d437e/uploads/origins/cf050277-0eb3-4fa4-9554-ce0da1f7969b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27665f2fe9ace7f4dc9e9b1a30b5343b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, I saw your appeal and thought your art looked cute!\nIf you wish, please draw Nazrin from Touhou Project.\nIt would be great if you can draw her in a cute cheerleader outfit, but feel free to draw her normal outfit instead as well.\nThank you very much!\n\nこんにちは、アピールを見て絵が可愛いなと思いました\nもしよろしければ、東方Projectのナズーリンちゃんを描いてください。\n可愛いチアガール姿で描いて頂けると嬉しいですが、普段の服装でも構いませんので描いて下さい。\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}